; oat — oberon-agent-tool — the stateless serial client for AgentTool.Mod on a
; live (booted) Oberon system, ported from the oberon-agent Rust CLI: the wire
; protocol, transport, retry policy, the typed operations, and the CLI surface.
; Wrapped, so the modules read Oat.Protocol / Oat.Tools / ... from outside.
; The executable lives in bin/; the on-system half lives in Mod/.

(library
 (name oat)
 (libraries oberon_tools unix))
